widthPercent": 7.059373539036932, "startText": "23:42", "start": 1778254967, "stage": "awake", "startPercent": 42.26273959794297, "endText": "23:45"}, {"end": 1778256202, "widthPercent": 50.677886863020106, "startText": "23:45", "start": 1778255118, "stage": "core", "startPercent": 49.322113136979894, "vitals": {"avgRespiratoryRate": 15, "avgHeartRate": 54.666666666666664, "maxHeartRate": 55, "minHeartRate": 54}, "endText": "00:03"}], "stages": {"core": 33, "awake": 3, "rem": 0, "unspecified": 0, "deep": 0}, "summary": {"startText": "23:27", "endText": "00:03", "end": 1778256202, "totalSleepMinutes": 33, "start": 1778254063}, "date": "2026-05-08"}], "schemaVersion": "health_sleep_v1", "generatedAt": 1778311935}, "id": "15FC0E56-C6CD-4730-B62C-C22D127BD80C"}, {"id": "14590FB4-65F9-4953-B56E-7D2A09558E15", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:39.463Z", "kind": "text", "text": "你昨天（5月8日）的睡眠总时长仅35分钟，其中有效睡眠（核心睡眠）33分钟，清醒占比8.4%，没有深度和REM睡眠，属于严重睡眠不足哦。\n\n建议你今天适当调整作息，尽量在23点前准备入睡，避免睡前使用电子设备，若持续出现短睡眠情况，建议排查是否有睡眠节律紊乱或其他影响睡眠的因素~", "updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:42.849Z"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "206170c4-0895-49e7-86a2-12c0893156f5", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "9f8ac741-d784-4f19-ad53-cebf3466c8b2", "server_message_id": "e89f9ecf-aedc-4a85-a631-5023f38068ef", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-09T14:20:45.375000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-10T08:11:37.410086+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"updatedAt": "2026-05-09T14:20:51.028Z", "kind": "text", "id": "652030BA-66B6-461F-9B24-B721F0706E4E", "text": "你好！我是你的专属健康助手 Spark，不管是运动、饮食、睡眠、健康管理相关的疑问，还是日程规划、知识查询等需求，都可以随时和我说哦~", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T14:20:49.698Z"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "7268ad45-1627-407a-9b80-ef11eacb7404", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "915af520-0e96-4f9b-a1f7-72f1a3d585b6", "server_message_id": "d115b623-6a6a-4c53-a0be-a9cb23dd3b1f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-10T08:11:27.439000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-10T08:11:37.415533+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"kind": "tool", "toolCallID": "call_wn3df19g5koy6iu7zoiv57il", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_wn3df19g5koy6iu7zoiv57il"}, "toolName": "query_member_profile", "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:10:51.053Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:10:51.735Z", "text": "正在使用工具：查询成员资料\n参数\n{\"query_type\": \"medications\", \"days\": 7}\n\n输出\nquery_type: medications\n参数提示：days=7（用药窗口）, limit=3（病例条数上限，Spark 当前汇总为全量计数）\n成员：赵道凯\n关系：self\n病例数：1\n症状数：1\n就诊数：1\n手术数：0\n随访数：0\n检查报告数：2\n体检主表数：1\n医技明细数：0\n医疗报告数：0\n药箱药品数：10\n处方数：0\n服药计划数：1\n今日服药记录数：0", "id": "4C057AB2-0DEE-4831-B747-D38C32C5BB22"}, {"kind": "tool", "toolCallID": "call_3ky2l6am5f7k6e16uopny5s0", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_3ky2l6am5f7k6e16uopny5s0"}, "toolName": "search_knowledge_bag", "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:10:58.833Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:10:59.135Z", "text": "正在使用工具：搜索知识库\n参数\n{\"query\": \"近期服用药物 赵道凯\"}\n\n输出\n知识库未匹配到相关文档。", "id": "5F70605C-57FD-41C4-9ECF-EB1EBF0853B4"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：检索记忆\n参数\n{\"keyword\": \"赵道凯;服用药物;2026-05\"}\n\n输出\n未检索到相关记忆。", "toolName": "retrieve_memory", "id": "704ECCFF-6F8E-4B55-AE7D-FDBF6070473E", "kind": "tool", "toolCallID": "call_05tka68kghrad3pdtc640n6w", "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:03.429Z", "anchor": {"value": "call_05tka68kghrad3pdtc640n6w", "type": "toolCall"}, "updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:03.891Z"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：询问用户\n参数\n{\"question\": \"请问你是想查询自己的用药记录，还是其他家庭成员的？\", \"selection_mode\": \"single\", \"options\": [\"我自己\", \"其他家庭成员\"], \"allows_other\": false}\n\n输出\n用户已提交选择：\n1. 请问你是想查询自己的用药记录，还是其他家庭成员的？\n   已选：我自己", "toolName": "ask_user_question", "id": "12B42F39-100A-45E8-B759-0B60C13BDADA", "kind": "tool", "toolCallID": "call_hgudh0w9kq763zd1ee7lu3ww", "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:06.295Z", "anchor": {"value": "call_hgudh0w9kq763zd1ee7lu3ww", "type": "toolCall"}, "updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:11.096Z"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:14.085Z", "text": "正在使用工具：检索记忆\n参数\n{\"keyword\": \"赵道凯;2026年5月9日;药物;剂量\"}\n\n输出\n未检索到相关记忆。", "toolCallID": "call_ca1efmvmjoczfyl1f1q8z1kn", "id": "5CB1B5F1-D3F9-40E0-AF5A-484241008994", "kind": "tool", "toolName": "retrieve_memory", "anchor": {"value": "call_ca1efmvmjoczfyl1f1q8z1kn", "type": "toolCall"}, "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:13.560Z"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:17.741Z", "text": "正在使用工具：查询成员资料\n参数\n{\"query_type\": \"medical_records\", \"limit\": 5}\n\n输出\nquery_type: medical_records\n参数提示：days=3（用药窗口）, limit=5（病例条数上限，Spark 当前汇总为全量计数）\n成员：赵道凯\n关系：self\n病例数：1\n症状数：1\n就诊数：1\n手术数：0\n随访数：0\n检查报告数：2\n体检主表数：1\n医技明细数：0\n医疗报告数：0\n药箱药品数：10\n处方数：0\n服药计划数：1\n今日服药记录数：0", "toolCallID": "call_ihwmww80lscua34eo8mxpaqo", "id": "5DA4FDFA-0589-408A-8E0E-2D45B75DE33E", "kind": "tool", "toolName": "query_member_profile", "anchor": {"value": "call_ihwmww80lscua34eo8mxpaqo", "type": "toolCall"}, "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:17.071Z"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:22.111Z", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_36uyi2dpysmbc2ek61nqvt76"}, "toolCallID": "call_36uyi2dpysmbc2ek61nqvt76", "text": "正在使用工具：保存记忆\n参数\n{\"content\": \"赵道凯2026年5月9日于苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）就诊，记录有药物服用信息：剂量30，频次每日3次，具体药物名称待补充\"}\n\n输出\n记忆已保存：赵道凯2026年5月9日于苏州大学附属第", "kind": "tool", "toolName": "save_memory", "id": "701F5212-5977-4A3B-A03F-5D84306B5D71", "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:20.387Z"}, {"text": "根据现有就诊记录，你最近（2026年5月9日于苏州大学附属第四医院/苏州市独墅湖医院就诊后）正在服用的药物记录为：**每次剂量30单位，每日服用3次**。\n目前系统暂未记录该药物的具体名称，建议你可以补充上传近期处方或药盒照片，我可以帮你完善用药信息，生成规范的服药提醒计划。", "createdAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:24.788Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-10T08:11:27.408Z", "id": "1887D9DF-811C-402E-AE22-269772268290", "kind": "text"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}]}}
