778256202, "startText": "23:27", "endText": "00:03", "start": 1778254063}, "date": "2026-05-08", "stages": {"deep": 0, "core": 33, "awake": 3, "rem": 0, "unspecified": 0}, "timeline": [{"vitals": {"maxHeartRate": 59, "avgHeartRate": 55.75, "minHeartRate": 54, "avgRespiratoryRate": 15.5}, "startText": "23:27", "widthPercent": 42.26273959794297, "startPercent": 0, "endText": "23:42", "start": 1778254063, "stage": "core", "end": 1778254967}, {"startPercent": 42.26273959794297, "end": 1778255118, "stage": "awake", "start": 1778254967, "widthPercent": 7.059373539036932, "startText": "23:42", "endText": "23:45"}, {"startPercent": 49.322113136979894, "end": 1778256202, "stage": "core", "start": 1778255118, "widthPercent": 50.677886863020106, "vitals": {"maxHeartRate": 55, "avgHeartRate": 54.666666666666664, "minHeartRate": 54, "avgRespiratoryRate": 15}, "startText": "23:45", "endText": "00:03"}]}], "schemaVersion": "health_sleep_v1"}}, {"id": "14590FB4-65F9-4953-B56E-7D2A09558E15", "kind": "text", "createdAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:39.463Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-09T07:32:42.849Z", "text": "你昨天（5月8日）的睡眠总时长仅35分钟，其中有效睡眠（核心睡眠）33分钟，清醒占比8.4%，没有深度和REM睡眠，属于严重睡眠不足哦。\n\n建议你今天适当调整作息，尽量在23点前准备入睡，避免睡前使用电子设备，若持续出现短睡眠情况，建议排查是否有睡眠节律紊乱或其他影响睡眠的因素~"}], "thread_id": "0C4B0BEE-CFEE-440D-8252-5862EF24E2D7", "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_system_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "created_at": "2026-05-09T07:32:10.865Z", "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "tombstone": false, "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}"}, {"client_message_id": "9F8AC741-D784-4F19-AD53-CEBF3466C8B2", "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "delivery_state": "pending", "role": "assistant", "blocks": [{"text": "你好！我是你的专属健康助手 Spark，不管是运动、饮食、睡眠、健康管理相关的疑问，还是日程规划、知识查询等需求，都可以随时和我说哦~", "id": "652030BA-66B6-461F-9B24-B721F0706E4E", "kind": "t